        "title": "Мир сегодня с \"Юрий Подоляка\"",
        "handle": "yurasumy",
        "verified": false,
        "avatar": "https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/AdHtTgWIua56bZDy2N2DQd44m9pJdrG0FbPO0jwWvjISpV7TljDIu9X-YsMMhzyo-QpSV4Ip48IGh_kmMFDObEABq62cFLx5EeWxgG9rrbGqHbyuA2CBNgkaFD0WfXXtIr7PoPHcVhDaftKviuaEDrgoO4EFSpdFcs2d8nQoiu3nMIBhmXROxSCZjJOtI9b8nERDkhPai_mlUPi30JvXzTwpHvPPrYLBDN2W_n8iYeAXp_Qgraw_RoOTtjyf2uERxYBQMeEjmpVMAKQYQc2PlyztJMP7E93_ZV1v9A9p5gORX6jqLWZAJmT60DRjMY2Eo-S7yO2RJJNMGcOPT4b-5g.jpg"
      },
      "sourceId": "ru:yurasumy",
